<li><a href="/services/roof-insurance-claim-assistance-temple-tx/">Insurance claim assistance</a> through documentation and estimates</li>
<li><a href="/services/asphalt-shingle-roofing-temple-tx/">Asphalt shingle roofing</a> and <a href="/services/metal-roofing-temple-tx/">metal roofing</a></li>
<li><a href="/services/gutters-roof-drainage-temple-tx/">Gutters and roof drainage</a></li>
<li><a href="/services/commercial-roofing-temple-tx/">Commercial roofing</a></li>
</ul>
<p>If you are budgeting ahead, the <a href="/tools/roof-replacement-cost-calculator/">roof replacement cost calculator</a> gives a rough starting range. An inspection will give you a written number for your actual roof.</p>

<h2>Straight Answers About Insurance and Deductibles</h2>
<p>Some roofing contractors in Temple, TX have promised to "cover your deductible." Texas law prohibits that. Under Texas Insurance Code Chapter 707, a contractor cannot waive, absorb or rebate a homeowner's deductible, and we won't. We also do not act as public adjusters. We can inspect, photograph damage, prepare an estimate and be on site when your adjuster visits if you would like us there.</p>

<h2>Serving Temple and the Surrounding Area</h2>
<p>Temple is our home base, and we also serve nearby communities including <a href="/service-areas/belton-tx/">Belton</a>, <a href="/service-areas/troy-tx/">Troy</a>, <a href="/service-areas/salado-tx/">Salado</a> and <a href="/service-areas/morgans-point-resort-tx/">Morgan's Point Resort</a>. See all of our <a href="/service-areas/">service areas</a>, or call to set up a free inspection.</p>
